repository-code: https://github.com/USERNAME/REPOSITORY
abstract: >-
  Measurement harness, raw measurement records and analysis code for a study of
  cold start cost across four serialization formats and three gradient boosting
  libraries. Contains 2,520 measurements, each taken in an isolated operating
  system process.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - gradient boosted decision trees
  - model deployment
  - serialization formats
  - cold start latency
  - ONNX Runtime
  - empirical software engineering
